  "bodyHash": "d27b520fc79043f2",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CG6HjQjW5c\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/512339624627011586?color=blue&label=discord&logo=discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dreams01\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=Dreams01&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fxdreamz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/租用服务器-cyan?style=for-the-badge&logo=Codeforces&logoColor=cyan\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dreams01/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/我的项目-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtSHUWL.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"202\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fel2-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wM7vHEd.png\"></strong></a></span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hlZBAoq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>《工程师生活2》是一款以技术类模组为核心的整合包，主要围绕</span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸工程（Immersive Engineering）</a><span>模组打造，适用于 Minecraft 1.16.5。在本整合包中，你将经历从收集燧石制作第一把镐子，到建造复杂且极具沉浸感的多方块机器与工厂的全过程。水车、风车、</span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%252fftb_gamepedia%252fimages%252f5%252f52%252fIE_Excavator.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">挖掘机</a><span>（配备大型旋转斗轮）、类似现实中的</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fp1DyylR.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">架空输电线路</a><span>、柴油发电机与</span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmedia.forgecdn.net%252fattachments%252f209%252f856%252foilfactory.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">磕头机（抽油机）</a><span>、手持采矿钻……你将在游戏的几乎各个方面发现大大小小的新增内容：为最挑剔的建筑师准备的额外建材、更多食物、种子与蜜蜂、家具与窗户。如果你厌倦了合成，也可以去探索周围的世界，发现大量隐藏的机制与结构（甚至可能包含新维度？）。尽管本整合包侧重于科技模组，但探索依然是游戏的重要组成部分；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">基于原版</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/engineers-life\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">《工程师生活》</span></a><span style=\"font-weight:400\">整合包的开发经验与玩家反馈，《工程师生活2》在多个方面对玩法进行了优化，包括：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">更直接、简化但仍具深度的进度系统（这也影响了任务引导的进度）；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">为不熟悉模组化 Minecraft 的玩家提供本整合包的入门指南；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">在开发的各个方面遵循 KISS（</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&laquo;保持简单，傻瓜&raquo;</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">）原则；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">面向更广泛的玩家群体，无论新手还是专家都能找到适合自己的玩法；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">可根据需求添加更多模组（添加前请在私信或 Discord 频道咨询）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">进度系统</span><strong>并未</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">被任何内容锁定，将玩法按阶段划分只是为了方便推进进度以及让你了解我对本整合包的设计思路。只要你拥有资源，随时都可以进行合成与游玩。只是部分配方会更复杂，需要更多的材料。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">如果你想要以下内容，那么本整合包绝对适合你：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">熟悉模组化 Minecraft 的玩法；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\">拒绝“大杂烩”式整合包。模组间内容几乎无重叠，模组更少，性能更好；</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">通过任务系统与文字指南获得清晰的引导；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">专注于科技类模组的整合包；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">贴近原版的游戏体验；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">在硬核或高难度整合包之后放松身心；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">在性能与玩法之间取得平衡。（基于已发布并测试过的整合包的经验）</span></span>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><em>需要和朋友一起玩服务器？不知道如何搭建？直接租用已配置好的服务器——<strong>一键安装和更新我的整合包（以及数十个其他整合包！）</strong>。为自己租用服务器也是对开发的支持！</em><em><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/xdreamz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Og8jfwS.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"134\"></a></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;点击上图选择套餐（至少 4GB），使用优惠码<strong>xdreamz</strong>可享首月<strong>25%</strong>折扣，与好友尽情游玩！</em></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QKWOqcn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>⚙️<em>&nbsp;<strong>加工与自动化：</strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义且更真实的合成配方；</li>\n<li>具有挑战性且平衡的玩法；</li>\n<li>从风车到多方块高炉的沉浸式外观功能机器；</li>\n<li>用传送带和架空输电线路替代管道；</li>\n<li><strong>蜜蜂</strong>现在更加<strong>高产</strong>！它们将为你提供从煤炭到钢铁的各种资源；<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://i.imgur.com/u75HDZ5.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片]</a></strong></li>\n<li>结合 Vanilla Food Pantry 和 Pam's Harvestcraft 模组，打造深度丰富的<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fBq4FlgH.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">食物</a></span></strong>合成系统；</li>\n<li>种植多种<strong>新树木</strong>与<strong>植物</strong>；<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252ft3Q6qOB.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片]</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fQcsS6Cv.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片2]</a></strong></li>\n<li>使用 <strong>veinminer</strong> 更方便地采集资源；</li>\n<li>观察季节更替并适应变化；</li>\n</ul>\n<p>📦<em><strong>整理与收纳：</strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>基础储物抽屉兼具实用性与美观性；</li>\n<li>从铜箱到钻石箱的额外储物柜，让你存放更多物品；</li>\n<li>通过简易存储模组将所有箱子连接至存储网络；</li>\n<li>使用磁盘在数字端存储物品！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>🛠️<em><strong>创造与建筑：</strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>来自 Quark 的新建材：石灰岩、板岩、碧玉、翡翠木、黑云母、彩色原木等；<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fAixuBa3.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片]</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>新家具</strong>：衣柜、床头柜、桌子、书架、橱柜；<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252flXXFIgn.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片]</a></strong></li>\n<li>增添一些 <strong><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252f9vYB1Wz.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式灯光</a>！</em></strong></li>\n<li>为你的写实建筑配备沉浸式 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fDugRhzu.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">窗户</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252ftpZJ9zN.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">门</a></strong>；</li>\n<li>真正的移动电梯！只需按下按钮，电梯就能将你及其他平台上的实体运送至多层楼；</li>\n</ul>\n<p>🗺️ <em><strong>探索世界：</strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>地下 Roguelike <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fXtiR7TH.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢结构</a>；</li>\n<li>搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a> 模组的模块化工具！；</li>\n<li>更新后的地下怪物刷怪笼；</li>\n<li>Quark 模组提供的独特写实世界，留有充足的探索空间；</li>\n<li><strong>基于任务的进度系统</strong>，附带奖励及部分机制说明；<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fDWTTOII.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片]</a></strong></li>\n<li>全新<strong>重制矿洞</strong>；<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://i.imgur.com/mO1UEwo.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">[图片]</a></strong></li>\n<li>为新手或迷失方向的玩家提供的在线文字指南；<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fel2-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\">[点击查看]</a></strong></span></li>\n<li>精心挑选并过滤的模组列表。你不会因不同模组的重复功能而感到繁杂，但所需内容一应俱全；</li>\n<li>不含以魔法为主的模组；</li>\n<li>支持添加你喜爱的模组而不会破坏整合包平衡；</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f49ktz0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v2CcUq3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gZc6WVJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/69D9gkC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9DJbKvv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wmn0yp1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"588\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5H7l2tq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZDPDIpV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"558\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpiXWca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"639\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cfgj9lL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"558\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qGLTCvf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XtiR7TH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Oian0U0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RCbv9Uo.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iDX03bg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/366j3Ck.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/njxonTe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1787\" height=\"1025\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TcyuhPa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fuGXFtp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hbddnUM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"639\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5KxwO2g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DhA9SMa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"470\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oLXjq85.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p1DyylR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/flADHl1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"640\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/webi8rG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCU3gwpclVZSYofj616OQKLQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mischief of Mice</a> 制作：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5_vXN39XEMc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOEUUMU8Q9Gt7umqQL4wsgQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elder Sign</a> 制作：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HWQaXZs_onU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTfCUt8O6mcUuh7UahSU3uQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">MisterZam</a> 制作：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I6bJn152_Is?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IFaFr8M.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\"></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2>EL2-1.16.5 - 1.0</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-mining-dimension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Mining Dimension</a>&nbsp;(от&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/henkelmax/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">henkelmax</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ageing-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ageing Spawners</a>&nbsp;(от&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrbysco/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mrbysco</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/akashic-tome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Akashic Tome</a>&nbsp;(от&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vazkii/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vazkii</a>)</